  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "Changing `EncAlikr05TemplateMelee` 06763C also needs Ismal (a row, level 13): he uses 06763C as his template but not for `Stats`.",
      "Changing `EncAlikr03TemplateMelee` 067636 changes Rakeed (a row; he takes `Stats` from it).",
      "Azadi uses the bandit leaf `EncBandit03Melee1HRedguardM` 039D0D (Bandits → *Common Bandits*) as template but not for `Stats`, so he keeps his own level when the bandit rung changes.",
      "Changing the Melee1H rungs drawn by `LCharAlikrMelee1H` 06766F also needs `ccBGSSSE031_LvlAlikrMelee1H_Female` 00080F:ccbgssse031-advcyrus.esm (Ghost Sailor, PC × 1.2, min 10, max 50): it takes its template from `LCharAlikrMelee1H`, which draws them, without `Stats` (on Undead → Ghosts → *Common Ghosts*).",
      "Majid the Mad (`EncAlikr06TemplateMelee`), the two Alik'r Mercenaries (`EncAlikr03TemplateMagic`, `EncAlikr02TemplateMissile`) and the Remnant Warriors M01 · M02 (`EncAlikr04TemplateMelee`) use a rung template without `Stats`, so changing that rung does not move them.",
      "The other rows: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "Every other Alik'r record (`WERJ03Alikr` 0B9285, `LvlAlikrMelee1H` 067672, and the Redguard Elite Armaments' `ccEDHSSE003_Fijeh` 000821:ccedhsse003-redguard.esl) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list. The 18 rung templates (06762F–067640) only carry the rung levels. Azzadal (`dunBardsLeapSummitGhost` 0B3C81, the Bard's Leap ghost) templates `LvlAlikrMelee1H` but is Essential and not an enemy."
    ]
  },
